@startuml AdaptiveLearningFlow
actor Student
participant UI
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Backend (Monolith)" as BE
participant "AI Service" as AIS
participant "Orchestrator Agent" as ORCH
participant "Analytics Agent" as ANALYTICS
participant "Tutor Agent" as TUTOR
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
collections "Vector DB" as VDB
collections "Cache" as CACHE
queue "Queue" as Q

Student -> UI: Request learning plan / next lesson
UI -> APIGW: /learning/plan or /recommendations
APIGW -> BE: request
BE -> PG: read profile, results, progress
BE -> AIS: adaptive request
AIS -> ORCH: intent=planner/adaptive
ORCH -> ANALYTICS: compute gaps (top 3)
ANALYTICS -> PG: aggregate performance
ANALYTICS --> ORCH: gap analysis
ORCH -> TUTOR: generate roadmap content
TUTOR -> VDB: optional retrieve references
TUTOR --> ORCH: plan + timeline
ORCH --> AIS
AIS --> BE
BE -> PG: save plan/recommendations
BE -> CACHE: cache dashboard snippets
BE --> UI: personalized plan

... after new exam/chat ...
BE -> Q: enqueue re-evaluation (async)
Q -> ANALYTICS: recompute progress + drift
ANALYTICS -> PG: update mastery/progress
@enduml
